msgid "Morph Cut"
msgstr ""

#: kdenlive/morphcut.xml
msgid "Hides jump cuts (e.g. in interviews) by generating the frames between the outgoing and the incoming clip with AI frame interpolation (RIFE). Place it over the cut; 6–12 frames are recommended."
msgstr ""

